### Create a user
# @name CreateUser
POST http://localhost:8000/users
X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY
X-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Signature: {{signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Agent Smith",
  "email": "agent.smith@example.com"
}

### List tasks for a project
# @name ListTasks
GET http://localhost:8000/tasks?project=PROJECT_ALPHA
X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY

### Bulk update task statuses
# @name BulkUpdateTasks
POST http://localhost:8000/tasks/bulk-update
X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updates": [
    {"task_id": "TASK_001", "status": "complete"},
    {"task_id": "TASK_002", "status": "in_progress"}
  ]
}

### Fetch metrics with dedicated credential
# @name Metrics
GET http://localhost:8000/metrics
X-Metrics-Key: YOUR_METRICS_KEY
